WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.050
Here's a simple habit that helps lower blood pressure. A five-minute walk.

00:05.550 --> 00:13.570
Walk for five minutes after each main meal. Breakfast, lunch and dinner. Three short walks add up to fifteen minutes a day.

00:14.070 --> 00:19.630
Walk at a pace where you can still talk, but not sing. A little out of breath is just right.

00:20.130 --> 00:26.210
Wear comfortable shoes, and pick a flat, shaded path. Early morning or evening is cooler.

00:26.710 --> 00:34.920
Over a few weeks, build up slowly to thirty minutes on most days. Regular walking can bring your top number down by a few points.

00:35.420 --> 00:41.790
Stop and rest if you feel chest pain, dizziness, or very short of breath. And tell your doctor.

00:42.290 --> 00:45.810
Start today. After your next meal.
